      <title>Astro Contrast Enhancer v0.9.574</title>

      <description>
        <p>Astro Contrast Enhancer provides protected Texture, Clarity, Dehaze, and lasso-based local contrast control for stretched astrophotography images.</p>
        <p><b>What's new:</b> Fixes high-zoom slider detail refresh state so 200%+ previews update reliably after Texture, Clarity, and Dehaze changes.</p>
      </description>

